  "answer_text": "The Indiana Pacers **did not qualify** for the **2026 NBA Playoffs**. They finished the 2025\u201326 regular season with a 19\u201363 record and were eliminated from postseason contention during the regular season. \n\nHowever, if you are looking for their matchups from their most recent playoff appearances, here is who they played:\n\n### **2025 NBA Playoffs (Run to the NBA Finals)**\nIn 2025, the Pacers had a historic run to the NBA Finals before falling in seven games. Their matchups included:\n*   **First Round:** Defeated the **Milwaukee Bucks** (4\u20131)\n*   **Eastern Conference Semifinals:** Defeated the **Cleveland Cavaliers** (4\u20132)\n*   **Eastern Conference Finals:** Defeated the **New York Knicks** (4\u20132)\n*   **NBA Finals:** Lost to the **Oklahoma City Thunder** (4\u20133)\n\n### **2024 NBA Playoffs (Run to the Eastern Conference Finals)**\nIn 2024, the Pacers also made a deep postseason run, reaching the Conference Finals:\n*   **First Round:** Defeated the **Milwaukee Bucks** (4\u20132)\n*   **Eastern Conference Semifinals:** Defeated the **New York Knicks** (4\u20133)\n*   **Eastern Conference Finals:** Lost to the **Boston Celtics** (4\u20130)",
